\section{Method}\zlabel{sec:method}

\begin{itemize}
  \item First, tokenize each sample with Oniguruma.
  \item Second, tokenize it with PCRE.
  \item[--] Finally, compare every token.
\end{itemize}

\begin{enumerate}
  \item Prepare the grammar;
  \item Run the benchmark.
\end{enumerate}

\begin{description}
  \item[Coverage] the share of rules that matched.
\end{description}

\subsection{Mathematics}

The total energy is
\begin{equation}\label{eq:energy}
  E = \frac{1}{2} m v^2 + m g h \quad \text{with } g \approx 9.81
\end{equation}
and the system of equations is
\begin{align*}
  x + y &= 10 \\
  x - y &= 2
\end{align*}
Display math with brackets:
\[
  \int_0^\infty e^{-x^2}\,dx = \frac{\sqrt{\pi}}{2}
\]
and with double dollars:
$$ \sum_{k=1}^{n} k = \frac{n(n+1)}{2} $$
\begin{empheq}[box=\fbox]{align}
  a &= b + c \\
  d &= e
\end{empheq}

